{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264H5q6anh6h1795783324.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>珠海航展下月7日開始舉行，繼解放軍海軍後，空軍、陸軍亦相繼公布參展裝備，其中殲20A、運20B等主戰裝備首次亮相，並參與空中展示。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.AIRSHOW-2000-1_CLEAN_20261127_203001_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nG72YEPyBO1795783549.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>航展臨近，部分展品陸續抵達珠海。首先到場的是大型水陸兩棲飛機AG600鯤龍，屆時將帶來12噸投水演示，展示應急救援實力。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.AIRSHOW-2000-1_CLEAN_20261127_203001_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bfgawLx5Ya1795783429.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>內地自行研製中遠程轟炸機，轟-6K亦出發，目前轟-6K已抵達珠海，進行裝備靜態展示的前期部署。未來幾日，空軍各類型裝備亦都陸續到珠海。解放軍空軍公布，選派33個型號的60多件裝備，以飛行展示，及地面靜態展示參展。亦會有俄羅斯、阿聯酋軍方表演隊，加入飛行表演，是2016年後再次同時有兩國外軍表演隊，參加中國航展。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h46m15s895.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AvBvy8uxqv1795783599.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外殲-35A、殲-20A、殲-16、運-20B、運油-20A等，國產主戰裝備亦會在空中飛行展示，當中殲-20A、運-20B是首次亮相中國航展。運-20B還會開放展示飛機貨艙。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h42m17s506.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PLisFqyZFQ1795783346.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>陸軍亦公布會展出6個裝備類型中，24個不同型號的現役裝備，同樣有室外靜態展示，室內展區展示及直升機飛行表演，當中室內展區是陸軍首次在航展開設。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.AIRSHOW-2000-1_CLEAN_20261127_203001_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H5VXJtfyIh1795783476.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>飛行表演方，有直-10、直-20，直-20T會參與，直-20T亦是首次在珠海航展展出。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.029821+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":488,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:43:41.475947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:17.494464+00:00","content_hash":"f88803612479c063623ce8840c5b1189b6108c302c64f60484d694090297325f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.029821+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}